<p>Continuously swing your steamsaws around you, dealing 30% weapon damage to adjacent foes each time you attack.</p><p>Your chaotic motions make it difficult for anything to hit you, granting <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>steampower 100">16%, 20%, 23%, 26%, 28%</acronym> chance to completely negate all damage.</p><p>Damage avoidance chance increases with Steampower.</p><p><span style="font-style: italic"><span class="tstr-font-italic">Make the metal talk!</span></span></p>